{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i><u>CHERNOBOTS</u></i></strong>\u00a0is a retro 3D procedurally generated roguelite set in the horrific Chernobyl Exclusion Zone. Search for highly radioactive targets that are top priority for removal. Use remote controlled robots equipped with cameras, flashlights, radiation detectors &amp; more to get the job done. Avoid being destroyed by mutated animals in various areas of the zone or pay the price. Earn money for completing tasks and upgrade your robotics further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>EXPLORE VARIOUS PROCEDURALLY GENERATED AREAS WITHIN THE CHERNOBYL EXCLUSION ZONE FOLLOWING THE NUCLEAR POWER PLANT DISASTER</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FIND RADIOACTIVE TARGETS THAT ARE TOP PRIORITY FOR RETRIEVAL AND REMOVAL</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>AVOID</strong>\u00a0<strong>MUTATED ANIMALS, HUNT THEM OR BE HUNTED</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>EARN MONEY FOR COMPLETING TASKS</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>UPGRADE REMOTE CONTROLLED ROBOTS</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DISCOVER\u00a0DIGITAL INTEL THAT TELLS A DEEPER STORY</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SEARCH AREAS THAT ARE DIFFERENT EVERY TIME</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MANAGE YOUR EXPENSES AND DECONTAMINATION COSTS</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BUY UPGRADES FOR YOUR ROBOTS &amp; MORE</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679190/extras/CHERNOB_STEAM_PAGE_BANNER.png?t=1746021105\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3679190?t=1746021105","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstati